cess type","sdk","access","section",[73],{"_57":74,"_25":75,"_76":77},"Unity testing SDK source","https://github.com/Regression-Games/RGUnityBots","note","Public client SDK source; it does not contain the complete hosted dashboard backend.","examples","demo",[81],{"_57":82,"_25":83,"_76":84},"Runnable Boss Room sample","https://github.com/Regression-Games/UITest-BossRoom","A complete Unity sample project with UI tests; download and open locally rather than playing in a browser.","tutorial",[87],{"_57":88,"_25":89,"_76":90},"Your first automated test","https://github.com/Regression-Games/RegressionDocs/blob/main/docs/getting-started/creating-your-first-automated-test.mdx","Official first-test walkthrough preserved in the documentation repository. The former live documentation domain was unreachable during review.","Source reviewed","2026-10-18","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[101,102],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[106,107],"stages","Testing","Build & release","Topics",[111,112,113,114,115],"tags","Unity","Automated playtesting","Input replay","Regression testing","Reference integration","Further reading",[118,119,120],{"_57":123,"_25":75},{"_57":122,"_25":83},{"_57":121,"_25":89},"First-test tutorial repository fallback","Boss Room UI-testing sample","Unity SDK","Project source",[126],{"_57":124,"_25":75},"Why it belongs here","The public Unity SDK combines gameplay recording, state inspection, input playback, bot logic, and validation workflows. Its official first-test tutorial and Boss Room UI-testing project remain available in GitHub repositories. Treat this as a reference integration: the old documentation domain was unreachable during review, and current hosted-service availability and maintenance were not confirmed. SDK source is public; check compatibility and service requirements before adopting it.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Tool","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","t